<title>POLAND: Animex revises down August, Q2 net profit.</title>
<headline>Animex revises down August, Q2 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised results August 1996</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p>    Net profit	     0.64 vs   1.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 1.47 vs   1.76</p>
<p>    Operating profit     1.71 vs   2.04</p>
<p>    Sales		   35.42 vs  46.98</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p>    Net profit	     9.18 vs   8.98</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	12.26 vs  10.02</p>
<p>    Operating profit     8.59 vs  16.95</p>
<p>    Sales		  290.54 vs 329.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Animex SA. The company earlier reported August net profit of 1.25 million zlotys, January- August net of 9.79 million and Q2 net of 3.63 million. It said the lower net profit was due to making a provision for income tax.</p>
<p>Final results for second quarter of 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1996    Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating				1.94   vs    4.99</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  4.84   vs    2.19</p>
<p>    net					3.42   vs    2.26</p>
<p>    net sales			    109.76   vs  120.68</p>
<p>    costs of sales			95.86   vs  109.35</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.41   vs    0.01 refund</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  31.35   vs    2.42</p>
<p>    financial costs		     28.45   vs    5.24</p>
<p>    investment			     7.80   vs    3.22</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
